{"id":518,"gn":"Pokémon Rêveur","ft":["La fumée qui sort de son front contient les rêves de nombreuses personnes et ceux de nombreux Pokémon.","Il peut matérialiser les rêves qu’il a mangés. La fumée qui sort de son front prend la forme des objets vus en rêve.","La fumée qui sort de son front change de couleur selon le contenu des rêves qu’il a mangés.","Il est recommandé de ne pas l’approcher quand la fumée qui sort de son front a une teinte noire, sinon son cauchemar risque de se matérialiser.","Il est sans cesse assoupi, plongé dans ses rêves. Il vaut mieux éviter de le déranger, car il est toujours mal luné au réveil."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":1,"23":0,"24":2,"25":0,"26":2,"33":3,"34":4},"tt":["La brume de rêve provenant de son front se transforme en plusieurs couleurs différentes selon le rêve qui a été mangé."],"tv":{"21":0,"22":0},"gr":4,"cr":75,"hc":10,"bh":70,"eg":["Terrestre"],"gw":"fast","gm":{"zadlc":[0,56],"sw":[0,91],"b2w2":[0,87],"bw":[0,24]},"f":{"518":{"n":"Mushana","t":["psychic"],"s":[116,55,85,107,95,29],"h":1.1,"w":60.5,"a":[[108,0],[28,0],[140,1]],"av":["zadlc","sw","b2w2","bw"],"ls":[{"l":[[678,1],[286,1],[236,1],[277,1],[428,1],[347,1],[281,1],[94,1],[585,1],[138,1],[248,1],[472,1],[500,1],[111,1],[95,1],[60,1]],"m":[63,86,94,113,115,129,133,156,157,164,173,182,203,213,214,219,240,247,248,263,270,271,285,286,317,347,360,384,385,412,416,428,433,472,473,496,500,502,605,678],"t":[797,802]},{"l":[[111,1],[381,1],[60,1],[95,1]],"m":[63,86,92,94,104,113,115,138,148,156,157,164,182,207,213,216,218,219,237,240,244,247,259,263,317,347,360,412,416,433,451,473,477,496],"t":[173,214,215,220,270,271,277,285,324,356,388,428,472,495]},{"l":[[111,1],[381,1],[60,1],[95,1]],"m":[63,86,92,94,104,113,115,138,148,156,157,164,182,207,213,216,218,219,237,240,244,247,259,263,317,347,360,412,416,433,451,473,477,496]}],"lm":{"sw":0,"b2w2":1,"bw":2},"go":{"a":183,"d":166,"s":253,"m50":3079,"m51":3115,"t":["psychic"],"bd":3,"fm":["ZEN_HEADBUTT_FAST","CHARGE_BEAM_FAST"],"cm":[